  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EC Chimborazo Development Investment Project (PIDD)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is to increase production and market access of rural families living in the Chambo and Chanchan-Chimbo river basins within Chimborazo Province, through investments in irrigation and roads improvement.</narrative>
  </description>
